VIII, 612. Abyssus et tenebrae super faciem abyssi. I, 827.
Abyssus abyssum invocans quid. I, 850.</P> <P COM="0046">Academia. In Academia, Archesilae Polemon, Polemoni
Xenocrates, Xenocrati Plato successit. II, 439. Academiae
