amare, ad eam ambulare est. IV, 1918.</P> <P COM="0348"><HI REND="ITALIC">Jesus</HI>  hebraice,  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Swthúr</FOREIGN>  graece, Salvator latine. VIII, 1025.
Jesus interpretatur Salvator, sive Salutaris. V, 944, 1334,
