tempore crux castigandi corporis assumenda.
V, 1039. Servanda conjugatis continentia. V, 1040,
1043, 1045, 1047, 1052. Eleemosynae largiores erogandae.
V, 1040, 1042, 1045, 1046, 1047, 1052, 1053. Finiendae inimicitiae.
